message: "Cite this repository at the commit used, and cite the original datasets and papers separately. See LICENSES.md for scope and third-party terms."
title: "FLIEGE: AI-assisted research toward an embodied fruit-fly model"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "IT-EXPRESS Bayern"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IT-EXPRESS-Bayern/Fliege"
url: "https://github.com/IT-EXPRESS-Bayern/Fliege"
