abstract: >-
  Ongoing research developed with GPT-6 SOL and GPT-6 ASTRA. Published connectomes,
  traceable neuron identities, controlled neural submodels, and browser-based body
  experiments. Full reconstruction is incomplete; original anatomy, model assumptions,
  and simulation results are distinct. Third-party data retain their original licenses.
